+      "content": "A semicolon or a full stop comes before the connector and a comma after it: *…; sin embargo, …*. Use a contrast connector only when the second idea goes against the first. For a result, use *por eso* or *así que*. When you report a political view, say whose view it is (*sus críticos decían*, *sus partidarios creen*)."
